e,\\\" said NHL Commissioner Gary Bettman in an exclusive interview.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"We've never seen anyone make the transition from basketball to hockey at this level before.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"He's a true pioneer.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Ames, who stands at 6'5\\\", has been practicing with the Columbus Blue Jackets for the past month, and sources close to the team indicate that he's already earned a spot on the starting lineup.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"\\\"It's been a whirlwind few weeks, but I'm thrilled to be here,\\\" Ames said in a phone interview.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"I've always loved the speed and physicality of hockey, and I'm excited to bring my unique skillset to the table.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"According to data provided by the NHL, Ames has been clocked at speeds of up to 25 miles per hour on the ice, making him one of the fastest players in the league.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"His shooting percentage is also an impressive 35%, with several scouts noting his uncanny ability to find the back of the net.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"While some have questioned the legitimacy of Ames' transition, citing the vastly different skills required for basketball and hockey, his new teammates are quick to defend his abilities.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"\\\"I was skeptical at first, but _ has earned my respect,\\\" said Blue Jackets captain Nick Foligno.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"\\\"He's a quick learner, and his work ethic is second to none.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"He's going to be a game-changer for us this season.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"As Ames prepares to take the ice for his NHL debut, fans and pundits alike are eagerly anticipating what promises to be a historic moment in sports history.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"Will _ Ames become the next big thing in the NHL?\"}]}"
